{"script":"sj_005_01","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":280,"y":-297,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":280,"transTime":300,"y":-297,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]真是令人惊叹。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]我也见过不少荒野客的营地，大都有个能做简单烤肉的火堆，最多加个杂草铺起来的睡床。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]虽说你们的这个营地范围稍微大一些，之前就可以堆放一些物资……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]但看看现在，精致的营火、华丽的营房，甚至还有一些加工用的设施。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]这么完善的功能，居然只占到既有空间的不到一半，该说不愧是专业工匠的手笔吗。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]这可不是客套话。你的手艺真是让我大开眼界。要是给你足够的建材，怕是连驿站旅店都要没了排面。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]这样想想，我要是现在就去找艾尔莎递辞呈，跑来跟你混的话，会不会更有前途呢？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]哈哈哈，当然是开玩笑的。毕竟我也并不是为了前途，才在驿站做侍者的。至于是为了什么嘛……以后有时间再告诉你吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"茜塔-对我们的营地感觉如何？"}